{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, then take and process it. Move to destination and drop object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />\"",
